{"about_the_game":"After months of hard work battling darkness, the IgKnights gather to have a great feast at the Guild Hall.<br><br>All was going well until right in the middle of the hall, a scuffle broke out. What started off as a small argument spiraled into an all out food war throughout the great hall. Thus the IgKnight tradition of the Food Fight Grand Battle was formed. <br><br>Challenge your friends and others to a food fight competition in VR!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>Up to 4 person multiplayer - Gather some friends (or enemies) to form teams and have some 1v1, 1v2 or 2v2 food fights! 30 seconds to see which team gets the most hits!<br><br>Throwing food is fun! Grab some food from the table and throw it at your opponent face! (or your team mate if you are sadistic) <br>Watch it splatter your face or opponent's face. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/9073c42b2a4991c166c1d47f5e94c4b8.poster.avif?t=1590050894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/9073c42b2a4991c166c1d47f5e94c4b8.webm?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/9073c42b2a4991c166c1d47f5e94c4b8.mp4?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Haptic Feedback (For users with bHaptics TACTAL) - you can feel the food when it hits your face for added immersion!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/7936bd2d86b78b013039dd4c2deb611c.poster.avif?t=1590050894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/7936bd2d86b78b013039dd4c2deb611c.webm?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/7936bd2d86b78b013039dd4c2deb611c.mp4?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Practice Mode - Throw the food against target boards to practice your aim and turrets to practice dodging or grabbing the thrown food.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/b3211c461779e9c6b493df0bd4309097.poster.avif?t=1590050894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/b3211c461779e9c6b493df0bd4309097.webm?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/b3211c461779e9c6b493df0bd4309097.mp4?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Kids Mode - Scales the world down so that they can play too! Remember to get them to wear wriststraps.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/47c3f49edff7365d715a39642c85a7d0.poster.avif?t=1590050894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/47c3f49edff7365d715a39642c85a7d0.webm?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/47c3f49edff7365d715a39642c85a7d0.mp4?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Avatar Customization - Choose your own avatar by customizing all parts of your body!<br><br>Arena Mode - Free for all scoring and a new crane hand dropping food around in a larger play area.<br>If you don't have a large play space to play in, use either teleport or artificial locomotion to move around. <br><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR  <br>Also available on SynthesisVR, PrivatelabelVR and Viveport","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"3a799bbfd46583aad25fcf991148d07c155c313d.jpg","localized_name":"Food Fighting for Dummies","name":"Food Fighting for Dummies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889150/3a799bbfd46583aad25fcf991148d07c155c313d.jpg"},{"icon":"5dd110f0a4b065cfa03bb5335db74affe7256252.jpg","localized_name":"In Your Face","name":"In Your Face","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889150/5dd110f0a4b065cfa03bb5335db74affe7256252.jpg"},{"icon":"ec41ac947c709eb0469df4cb244ac044aeeb98d1.jpg","localized_name":"Winner Winner","name":"Winner Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889150/ec41ac947c709eb0469df4cb244ac044aeeb98d1.jpg"},{"icon":"2f502ca497f95b65ed5ecad27aa48c8f7592e52e.jpg","localized_name":"That Doesn't Go in There","name":"That Doesn't Go in There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889150/2f502ca497f95b65ed5ecad27aa48c8f7592e52e.jpg"},{"icon":"1e654fecaf9f047b74fe9f2dff9be38ff74662f2.jpg","localized_name":"Kung Food Fighter","name":"Kung Food Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889150/1e654fecaf9f047b74fe9f2dff9be38ff74662f2.jpg"},{"icon":"2809538a7b5274168f9c7db2f0e41bce0145fdc6.jpg","localized_name":"Your Loss","name":"Your Loss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889150/2809538a7b5274168f9c7db2f0e41bce0145fdc6.jpg"},{"icon":"5ad5a0456e85b5d31a43d709312fca2ca0a0065f.jpg","localized_name":"You Need to Do Batter","name":"You Need to Do Batter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889150/5ad5a0456e85b5d31a43d709312fca2ca0a0065f.jpg"},{"icon":"e27f229cc6952195194967e47022fde9acfd4ded.jpg","localized_name":"Window Shot","name":"Window Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889150/e27f229cc6952195194967e47022fde9acfd4ded.jpg"},{"icon":"ef3a240eb5c377a09680b645e597303eb93ca9f4.jpg","localized_name":"Full Gingerbread House","name":"Full Gingerbread House","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889150/ef3a240eb5c377a09680b645e597303eb93ca9f4.jpg"},{"icon":"2fdaedc9315c747e480866b062e7509c99be8772.jpg","localized_name":"There's a Banana in My Ear","name":"There's a Banana in My Ear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889150/2fdaedc9315c747e480866b062e7509c99be8772.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/889150?t=1590050894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/889150?t=1590050894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1590050894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1590050894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Custom &amp; Commercial Versions</h1><p>Engage us to add your own branding into this game for a custom version for use at arcades or events.<br>Check out our website for some examples!<br><br><br>Arcade Commercial Version is available also on Steam and Viveport Arcade and Direct for per month plan; Synthesis VR, Private Label VR for per minute scheme, Viveport Arcade for per hour plan.<br>Includes: <br>- LAN multiplayer for more reliable connectivity, <br>- Spectator screen for better audience viewing<br>- Operator Control Panel for faster troubleshooting and turnaround<br>- Unlocked Skins<br>- Free roam setup config<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/0e82848ab5b569cbf7b2b3789133100f.poster.avif?t=1590050894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/0e82848ab5b569cbf7b2b3789133100f.webm?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/0e82848ab5b569cbf7b2b3789133100f.mp4?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>After months of hard work battling darkness, the IgKnights gather to have a great feast at the Guild Hall.<br><br>All was going well until right in the middle of the hall, a scuffle broke out. What started off as a small argument spiraled into an all out food war throughout the great hall. Thus the IgKnight tradition of the Food Fight Grand Battle was formed. <br><br>Challenge your friends and others to a food fight competition in VR!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>Up to 4 person multiplayer - Gather some friends (or enemies) to form teams and have some 1v1, 1v2 or 2v2 food fights! 30 seconds to see which team gets the most hits!<br><br>Throwing food is fun! Grab some food from the table and throw it at your opponent face! (or your team mate if you are sadistic) <br>Watch it splatter your face or opponent's face. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/9073c42b2a4991c166c1d47f5e94c4b8.poster.avif?t=1590050894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/9073c42b2a4991c166c1d47f5e94c4b8.webm?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/9073c42b2a4991c166c1d47f5e94c4b8.mp4?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Haptic Feedback (For users with bHaptics TACTAL) - you can feel the food when it hits your face for added immersion!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/7936bd2d86b78b013039dd4c2deb611c.poster.avif?t=1590050894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/7936bd2d86b78b013039dd4c2deb611c.webm?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/7936bd2d86b78b013039dd4c2deb611c.mp4?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Practice Mode - Throw the food against target boards to practice your aim and turrets to practice dodging or grabbing the thrown food.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/b3211c461779e9c6b493df0bd4309097.poster.avif?t=1590050894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/b3211c461779e9c6b493df0bd4309097.webm?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/b3211c461779e9c6b493df0bd4309097.mp4?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Kids Mode - Scales the world down so that they can play too! Remember to get them to wear wriststraps.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/47c3f49edff7365d715a39642c85a7d0.poster.avif?t=1590050894\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/47c3f49edff7365d715a39642c85a7d0.webm?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/extras/47c3f49edff7365d715a39642c85a7d0.mp4?t=1590050894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Avatar Customization - Choose your own avatar by customizing all parts of your body!<br><br>Arena Mode - Free for all scoring and a new crane hand dropping food around in a larger play area.<br>If you don't have a large play space to play in, use either teleport or artificial locomotion to move around. <br><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR  <br>Also available on SynthesisVR, PrivatelabelVR and Viveport","developers":["Ignite VR"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889150/header.jpg?t=1590050894","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/889150/214782/520d85bca95fea03a415cac8d128d43bea08b8a2/1751158961/dash_av1.mpd?t=1553390991","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/889150/214782/520d85bca95fea03a415cac8d128d43bea08b8a2/1751158961/dash_h264.mpd?t=1553390991","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/889150/214782/520d85bca95fea03a415cac8d128d43bea08b8a2/1751158961/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1553390991","id":256746094,"name":"IgKnight Food Fight Mixed Reality Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256746094/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1553390991"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/889150/247463/bf7e60c7000f41bda8a5